{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1012827-family-and-hunger-that-fit-perfectly","id":1012827,"title":"Family and Hunger That Fit Perfectly","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-05T15:40:16-08:00","id":1012827,"title":"Family and Hunger That Fit Perfectly","content":"In some CoD games we get a Clan/Auspice combo with a certain Tribe/Covenant that just fits really well, thematically and/or mechanically. <br /> I would venture to say that in <i>Werewolf</i>, for example, there are some Tribes that are just a perfect fit for a particular Auspice. That's my impression of it, anyway.<br /> <br /> I was wondering if anyone thought the same about Beast.<br /> There's one section in the Nemeses' description that says that the Namtaru are particularly well-suited for the Hunger for Punishment, and their Family description makes it obvious why. <br /> <br /> Do you guys have any particular combos that you feel are &quot;just right&quot;? <br /> <br /> What do you think about matching Hunger with the kind of supernatural creature you might have Kinship with?<br /> For example, would a Hunger for Prey work particularly well for a Beast with Family Ties to a werewolf? Or do you think that having tastes be too similar would actually lead to tension and friction (for say, between a Tyrant and an Invictus vampire both trying to gain influence and domain)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1807-serpent-axis","name":"Serpent Axis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1807_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-05T16:12:15-08:00","id":1012852,"title":"","content":"Anakim and Power have a lot of synergy, as do Eshmaki and Prey. There's also Ugallu and [REDACTED], but we can't talk about that quite yet...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-06T10:13:23-08:00","id":1013252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1012827-family-and-hunger-that-fit-perfectly?p=1012852#post1012852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's also Ugallu and [REDACTED], but we can't talk about that quite yet...</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. So does this mean we are getting new Hungers in the Player's Guide? (I hope Excess is one of them, if so).<br /> <br /> Ugallu seem to work well with Prey for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-06T20:32:28-08:00","id":1013566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1012827-family-and-hunger-that-fit-perfectly?p=1012852#post1012852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anakim and Power have a lot of synergy, as do Eshmaki and Prey. There's also Ugallu and [REDACTED], but we can't talk about that quite yet...</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm concerned that the Ugallu and Boogaloo combination might be too strong, especially with either the Storm Lashed Atavism or even the Electrified Lair Trait.<br /> <br /> I'm sure you guys know what you're doing though. ^.^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"use